Z||000000||lowfierogt||12-04-2001||11:38 PM||||Well I bought a 86 GT and It had some bad little friends in the car. I got the car from a farm in the middle of BFE.  Well, Went out there to work on the car and seen the mouse watching me so tonight, I got some peanutbutter and some traps.   It was kinda funny.  I put one trap on the center consold and left to get something from the house, get back out there and the big mouse was eating the PB.   It eate all the stuff so started moving the trap and jumped on it then after 4-5 minutes it got it.  Yes, It died.  I'll teach them to SH^^ in my Fiero. <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://lowfierogt.no-ip.com/lowfierogtsig.gif">         <BR>http://lowfierogt.no-ip.com<BR>86 1/2 GT<BR>85 GT Project, fastback V8<BR>87 coupe Getting V6 daily driver over 300k miles||||reg||1
Z||000001||JetroGT||12-05-2001||12:50 AM||||That's worse than the ants I had in my car over the summer. I think they were fire ants cause they left a nasty bump where one of them bit me. <BR>Ant traps and two weeks to get rid of them.||||reg||10
