Z||000004||fierohoho||12-05-2001||02:07 AM||||They jump.<P>My '84 had the entire brake light running light harness chewed through when I got it but thats all the little b******s did.<P>Took about 2 hours to splice every thing back together.<P>lowfierogt, what part of Egypt, Minnesota did you get your car from?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lightbar.gif"> ||||reg||1
